    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d550">

                <pb facs="0744" n="732" xml:id="pg732"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">103.9169/1–145: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-01-01T20:00:00+01:00">January 1, 1945—8
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received January 1—4:42 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>18. For Department and FEA.<anchor n="5" xml:id="d550-f1"/> MEW<anchor n="6"
                        xml:id="d550-f2"/> was informed by Swedish Legation here December 30 that
                    Swedes have agreed to consider Interim Agreement in force as of January 1,
                    1945.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
